comment.narrative:
Out of the five contracts (Wolkite-Hossaina- two; and Mekenajo-Dembidolo-three),&nbsp;3 contracts: two of Wolkite-Hossaina and one in Mekenajo Dembidolo, constituting 60% of all&nbsp;contracts, were complete within the contract time.&nbsp;&nbsp;However&nbsp;two Contracts in Mekenajo-Dembidolo are lagging behind.

In terms of budget, all the five&nbsp;contracts are within acceptable limits (&lt;15% of the original signed&nbsp;contracts).&nbsp;&nbsp;

&nbsp;
